            {
                "entry_id": "145815a9-eea1-3cfb-8576-cd8d75c5a277",
                "word": "nonprofit",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f5c3fdce-420c-4f34-b11c-865b681eadaa",
                        "entry_id": "145815a9-eea1-3cfb-8576-cd8d75c5a277",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "nonprofits"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                        "entry_id": "145815a9-eea1-3cfb-8576-cd8d75c5a277",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipsis of nonprofit organization (“an organization that exists for reasons other than to make a profit, such as a charitable, educational or service organization”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "ellipsis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7a453b5-5534-4a04-9227-e8246d4d20f9",
                                "sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                                "text": "Historically, companies have viewed nonprofits primarily as recipients of their philanthropy – usually in the form of cash and product donations, as well as employee volunteers, in exchange for a boost to their reputations or stronger relationships with local stakeholders."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5de84ff-fc95-4cc0-93fc-530df453d27e",
                                "sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                                "text": "The people who made millions or billions from these companies are now changing yet another sector of the American economy: philanthropy. They’re forcing nonprofits to become incubators and disruptors, rather than just service providers, and to think about how they sell themselves, how they measure what they do, and what programs will attract money."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33084ec0-4f79-4641-bcc0-8e81c1a6ba87",
                                "sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                                "text": "They make up one of three community outreach teams employed by OnPoint, a New York City nonprofit that provides services for people who use drugs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7d4bac9-523f-4894-b1e8-8dcf076408b3",
                                "sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                                "text": "The shelter, an independent nonprofit, was originally a pilot project of Trinity Lutheran Church of Manhattan, and still occupies its basement on the Upper West Side."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3fc401c5-57cb-4469-b1af-3dc9db36cc53",
                        "source_entry_id": "145815a9-eea1-3cfb-8576-cd8d75c5a277",
                        "source_sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                        "source_sense_description": "non-profit organization — see also NPO",
                        "target_lang_word": "neziskovka",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "neziskovka",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "148eab54-a902-32fa-8b92-91f4d84fdc32",
                                        "entry_id": "137b3bfb-e1be-3dd1-891c-551041781e97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nezisková organizace"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "305e7e81-9c76-4336-bd3d-c78a1541e65d",
                                                "sense_id": "148eab54-a902-32fa-8b92-91f4d84fdc32",
                                                "text": "Nebudeme se [lékaře] na operačním stole například ptát, koho volí (…). Ale asi by nás šokovalo, kdyby se na něco podobného se skalpelem v ruce zeptal on nás. \"Koho volíte? Nejste náhodou novinář? Nebo dokonce muslim? Nepracujete v neziskovce? Já jen, jestli si mám dát záležet, nebo vás můžu odfláknout."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5086c09e-6e88-40ca-bd3a-ca706ec49630",
                        "source_entry_id": "145815a9-eea1-3cfb-8576-cd8d75c5a277",
                        "source_sense_id": "d142c301-5314-3f3a-939f-e8d78e20795e",
                        "source_sense_description": "non-profit organization — see also NPO",
                        "target_lang_word": "non-profitorganisatie",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "non-profitorganisatie",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb81cd93-3be5-373a-9a2c-f266d7d26cbe",
                                        "entry_id": "7fede76a-536a-3872-a0a9-5743a99eb0fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een organisatie die niet is gericht op het maken van winst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9f31f32-61b7-40b2-95a7-b6de20e2442d",
                                                "sense_id": "fb81cd93-3be5-373a-9a2c-f266d7d26cbe",
                                                "text": "‘Reset Home is een non-profitorganisatie. We gaan niet plots wel een kunstwerk verkopen omdat het van Luc Tuymans is en dus een grote kapitale waarde heeft. Dat strookt niet met onze visie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a4ec5b6-60c3-460a-a9f5-45feeb9d7fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "fb81cd93-3be5-373a-9a2c-f266d7d26cbe",
                                                "text": "Zeven scholieren uit de gemeente Twenterand die op het punt staan over te stappen van de basisschool naar het voortgezet onderwijs, worden woensdag en donderdag via een intensieve cursus voorbereid op het nieuwe schooljaar in de brugklas. Het gaat om kinderen die verlegen zijn, weinig zelfvertrouwen en een negatief zelfbeeld hebben en/of zijn gepest op de lagere school. De cursus - Plezier op School - is een initiatief van Mindfit/Preventie GGZ, een non-profitorganisatie die zich toelegt op het versterken van het psychische welzijn van inwoners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
